+    | null-receiver:java.lang.NullPointerException: Cannot set property 'name' on null object:null
+    | nested:groovy.lang.MissingPropertyException: No such field found: field java.util.ArrayList name:[a, b]
+    | safe:groovy.lang.MissingPropertyException: No such field found: field java.util.ArrayList name:[a, b]
+    | + touch after-caught-assignment.txt
+  workspace:
+    e3b0c44298fc  after-caught-assignment.txt
+
+## Fogell
